
## 1. AWS Security Hub: Enabled Security Standards

This section lists all compliance standards available in AWS Security Hub for account `{{ account_id }}`.

The table below indicates which standards are currently enabled. You can click on the standard name to view more details in the AWS Console.

{% if not standards %}

*No security standards enabled for this account in region `{{ region_name }}`.*

{% else %}

| Security standard | Enabled |
|-------------------|:-------:|
{%- for sub in standards %}
{%- set std_name = sub.get('Name', 'N/A') %}
{%- set std_arn = sub.get('StandardsArn', '') %}
{%- set match = std_arn | regex_search('::standards/([^/]+)/v/([^/]+)') %}
{%- set status = sub.get('Enabled', False) %}
{%- set emoji = "✅" if status else "❌" %}
{%- if match and status %}
{%- set std_code = match[0] %}
{%- set std_version = match[1] %}
{%- set standard_link = "https://eu-north-1.console.aws.amazon.com/securityhub/home?region=eu-north-1#/standards/" ~ std_code ~ "-" ~ std_version %}
| [{{ std_name }}]({{ standard_link }}) | {{ emoji }} |
{%- else %}
| {{ std_name }} | {{ emoji }} |
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}

